  summary: "An interdisciplinary field focused on understanding and preventing accidents through the analysis of complex systems, human factors, and organizational processes. It emphasizes the 'Swiss cheese model' of accident causation, where multiple layers of defense are required to prevent failure. This approach is widely applied to high-stakes industries to ensure reliability and public safety.",
