  summary: "This research focuses on decomposing the architecture of Transformer models to understand how specific components, such as attention heads, process information. It maps the flow of data through the network to identify the 'circuits' responsible for specific tasks like induction or syntactic parsing. This granular analysis is vital for predicting model capabilities and failure modes.",
