  summary: "An intellectual and cultural movement that advocates for the use of advanced technologies to enhance human physical and cognitive abilities. It seeks to overcome fundamental human limitations such as aging, disease, and cognitive constraints. Proponents argue that humanity should actively guide its own evolution through science.",
