  summary: "Extropianism is an early, libertarian-leaning branch of transhumanism that emphasizes the continuous improvement of the human condition through technology. It promotes values like self-transformation, practical optimism, and open society. It serves as a key intellectual precursor to modern Silicon Valley techno-optimism.",
