  label: "Transhumanist philosophy and cosmism (Moravec, Kurzweil, Fedorov)",
  summary: "A philosophical movement advocating for the use of science and technology to enhance human physical and cognitive abilities. Cosmism, particularly in the Russian tradition, extends this to the mastery of space and the resurrection of the dead through scientific means. These ideas challenge traditional notions of human nature and biological limits.",
